ng the reign of her paternal grandfather, King George V. She was the first child of the Duke and Duchess of York (later King George VI and Queen Elizabeth the Queen Mother).","image":"Queen Elizabeth II official portrait for 1959 tour (retouched) (cropped) (3-to-4 aspect ratio).jpg","birth":1926.3013698630136,"death":2022.6849315068494}},"media":{"Flag of Saint Kitts and Nevis.svg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Flag_of_Saint_Kitts_and_Nevis.svg/330px-Flag_of_Saint_Kitts_and_Nevis.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Saint_Kitts_and_Nevis.svg","author":"Edrice Lewis","license":"Public domain"},"Coat of Arms of Saint Kitts and Nevis.svg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Coat_of_Arms_of_Saint_Kitts_and_Nevis.svg/330px-Coat_of_Arms_of_Saint_Kitts_and_Nevis.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coat_of_Arms_of_Saint_Kitts_and_Nevis.svg","author":"BaronJaguar","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"King Charles III (July 2023).jpg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/King_Charles_III_%28July_2023%29.jpg/330px-King_Charles_III_%28July_2023%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:King_Charles_III_(July_2023).jpg","author":"White House","license":"Public domain"},"Terrance Drew 2022.jpg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Terrance_Drew_2022.jpg/330px-Terrance_Drew_2022.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Terrance_Drew_2022.jpg","author":"Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Republic of China (Taiwan)","license":"Attribution"},"Queen Elizabeth II official portrait for 1959 tour (retouche